SUMMARY:Happy Hour in The Garden with Scott Ray Laws
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Happy Hour in The Garden with Scott Ray Laws. Scott brings a mix of folk\, Americana\, roots rock\, and acoustic favorites that pair perfectly with a summer afternoon. Grab a drink\, find a seat in The Garden\, and enjoy a couple hours of live local music in a relaxed outdoor setting. Whether you’re stopping by after work or meeting up with friends\, it’s a great way to ease into the evening. \nFree and all ages.
