SUMMARY:Lavender Sunset Evenings at Bees N Blooms
DESCRIPTION:Lavender Sunset Evenings during Lavender Bloomfest: Fridays – May 29 & every Friday in June\, 6 pm – 9 pm. Admission $15 per person. Kids 12 and under are free with an adult.\nThere’s nothing quite like experiencing lavender at sunset\, when the Labyrinth glows with soft evening light. This year\, we’re opening the farm for a limited number of special evening hours during peak bloom. We’ll have a food truck on site\, or bring your own dinner to savor in the Pavilion as the sun sets over the farm.\nBeesNBlooms is a certified organic farm with a lavender labyrinth\, butterfly garden\, ducks\, geese and chickens\, a nursery with many lavender varieties\, pollinator plants & garden starts and a farm stand with Lavender products.\nBees N Blooms Lavender Labyrinth\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404\ninfo@beesnblooms.com\n707-293-8293 \nHome
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/lavender-sunset-evenings-at-bees-n-blooms/
LOCATION:Bees N Blooms\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival,Holiday,Kids and Family,Other,Recreation
GEO:38.40006;-122.69607
