SUMMARY:Lavender Bloom Fest at BeesNBlooms
DESCRIPTION:Lavender Bloom Fest\, May 23 – July 12\, Saturdays & Sundays 10am to 4 pm\, Reservations required. Admission $15 person most days except Sunday featuring the jazz band then admission is $20. Kids 12 and under are free with an adult.\nLate May through mid-July is lavender bloom time at Bees N Blooms. This is the perfect time to experience everything the BeesNBlooms farm has to offer\, especially the Lavender Labyrinth. To ensure enough parking and a comfortable experience for all guests\, reservations are required.\nBeesNBlooms is a certified organic farm with a lavender labyrinth\, butterfly garden\, ducks\, geese and chickens\, a nursery with many lavender varieties\, pollinator plants & garden starts and a farm stand with Lavender products.\nBees N Blooms Lavender Labyrinth\, 3883 Petaluma Hill Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404\ninfo@beesnblooms.com\n707-293-8293 \nHome
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/lavender-bloom-fest-at-beesnblooms-9/
