SUMMARY:Paella at the Farm at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Made with locally sourced ingredients and finished with our very own Gold Ridge Organic Farms Extra Virgin Olive Oil\, this mouth-watering dish will be served to the sounds of live Spanish guitar by Bay Area musician\, Jean-Paul. \nThere’s plenty more to enjoy while you’re here. Sample our award-winning organic olive oils and apple products\, cool off with an apple cider slushie or Straus ice cream drizzled with apple cider syrup\, and pick up something special from the Farm Shop. You can also meet the makers behind Bella Rosa Coffee and Tienda Salsita\, two Sonoma County favorites. \nTake a ride through our olive and apple orchards on the apple-themed decorative trolley. Tours depart at 11:30AM\, 12PM\, 12:30PM\, 1PM\, 1:30PM\, and 2PM. \nFree entry. Food\, drinks and tour tickets for purchase on the day. Paella available from 11:30AM to 2:30PM or until sold out. \nURL:\nWebsite: https://go.evvnt.com/3655758-0?pid=5514 \nDate and Time: Saturday\, 20 June 2026 at 11:00 – 15:00 \nVenue details: Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Road\, Sebastopol\, California\, 95472\, United States \nCategory: Food / Drink
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/paella-at-the-farm-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/
