SUMMARY:Summer Garden Party
DESCRIPTION:Gather your friends and settle in for a laid-back summer afternoon on our Terrace and The Green\, where good company\, great wine\, and feel-good music set the tone. This easygoing outdoor gathering\, open to all ages\, is the perfect way to kick off the season of warm\, unhurried days. Bring your own picnic\, enjoy live music\, make the perfect summer arrangement at our flower bar Bouquet Bar\, and pick out a playful design from our talented face painter. \nIncluded in your ticket is a wine cocktail\, charcuterie cup\, delicious summer dessert\, face painting\, and live music. \nAdditional costs are the flower bar\, wine by the glass and bottle service.
