SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Lindsay Gang
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come together. \nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tasting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from across the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \nLindsay Gang\nLindsay Gang is a dynamic singer-songwriter whose music blends folk\, rock\, and Americana with compelling storytelling and rich vocal expression. Known for heartfelt lyrics and engaging performances\, Lindsay brings energy and emotional depth to every stage\, creating moments that draw listeners into the song and leave a lasting impression. \nDetails\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/saturday-live-music-at-spicy-vines-feat-lindsay-gang/
